# Eval fixtures contain CLIENT-CONFIDENTIAL proposal content (client names,
# scope, sizing, commercial structure). This repository is public — fixtures
# must never be committed. Keep them locally or in the private Drive alongside
# the source proposals. Only docs/evals/README.md (the convention) is tracked.
